you can write a loop that goes over several models, somethng like this

write the model syntax for several models

mod1 <- ' '
mod2 <- ' '
mod3 <- ' '

set models in a list

mod_list <- list(mod1,mod2,mod3)

write a loop that goes over every syntax in the list

results <- list()
for(i in 1:length(mod_list)){

fit_temp <- cfa(mod_list[[i]], data=dat, std.lv <http://std.lv>=T)

results[[i]] <- fit_temp
}

The results object is a list with every model result from the cfa function

